*
!src/
!models/
!case-studies.sh
!requirements.txt

# `!src/` above un-ignores everything beneath it, which swept a host
# src/__pycache__ into the image -- .pyc files built by whatever Python is
# installed locally, not the 3.12 the image runs. Harmless (mismatched magic
# numbers are ignored, and PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE stops new ones) but dead
# weight. Re-excluded here, after the negations, so this wins.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
